  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760356,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Release in '90: Commodore 64 - Synopsis\n\nStep into the boots of a manager in the thrilling world of English football with *1st Release in '90*! This fast-paced, text-based football management simulation for the Commodore 64 puts you in charge of a team from the top four divisions, challenging you to guide them to glory. \n\nScour the leagues for promising talent, strategically build your squad, and craft winning formations. Each match delivers intense action, followed by detailed reports on player injuries, crucial results from rival games, and a vital overview of your club's finances.  Careful management of your budget is key to success – invest wisely in players, training, and facilities to stay ahead of the competition.\n\nExperience the pressure of the manager's chair as you navigate transfers, deal with injuries, and strive for promotion.  Can you lead your team to the Premier League and dominate English football? *1st Release in '90* offers a deep and rewarding management experience, perfect for fans of the beautiful game."
    },
